{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24575","headline":"游平泉宴浥涧宿香山石楼赠座客 · 白居易","name":"游平泉宴浥涧宿香山石楼赠座客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逸少集兰亭，季伦宴金谷。\n金谷太繁华，兰亭阙丝竹。\n何如今日会，浥涧平泉曲。\n杯酒与管弦，贫中随分足。\n紫鲜林笋嫩，红润园桃熟。\n采摘助盘筵，芳滋盈口腹。\n闲吟暮云碧，醉藉春草绿。\n舞妙艳流风，歌清叩寒玉。\n古诗惜昼短，劝我令秉烛。\n是夜勿言归，相携石楼宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}